  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A go-to brush to blend out any complexion product so well that you won't be able to tell where your skin and makeup meet.<b><br><br>Brush Formulation:</b> All Formulas<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Buildable<br><b><br>Brush Handle Length: </b>3.5 inches<b><br><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> It is vegan, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This high-performance foundation brush seamlessly blends The Minimalist Perfecting Complexion Foundation and Concealer Stick formula (sold separately) into skin, softly blurring imperfections for a natural-, almost-airbrushed-looking finish.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-After applying The Minimalist Perfecting Complexion Foundation and Concealer Stick, Flush Balm Cream Blush, or Day Glow Highlighting Balm (each sold separately), move the brush lightly in circles to buff into skin.</div></details>",
